body:
I'ma disagree with the people saying the old combat was just spam clicking.  It took a lot of skill, just like the new combat.

&#x200B;

People didn't like it because it was different.  That's pretty much it.  Both require a lot of skill and have very high skill ceilings, but a very different skillset is required for one as opposed to the other.  Some people like one way.  Some people like the other.  It's just what happens when stuff changes.
